{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "fbc0c7378e0576f40c7c71a68cd719f7009a92fddf2bb3bf1d9c9178705326d1", "ja": "令嬢の世界へようこそ", "zh": "欢迎来到千金小姐的世界", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "28a5b240d0c8eaf6aa49d30cb55d4192196cbe066b92bba7830bab4e9f38a3cc", "ja": "伊織、静香、真、亜利沙、可奈の映画出演が\n決まる。舞台は貴族の社交界。コメディで\nありつつ所作や雰囲気が重視されることに\n不安を抱える中、可奈の発案で令嬢としての\n立ち振る舞いの先生役に伊織が抜擢される。", "zh": "伊织、静香、真、亚利沙、可奈确定出演电影。舞台设定为贵族的社交界。在这部重视举止和氛围的喜剧中，大家对自己的表现感到不安。于是，在可奈的提议下，伊织被选为教导大家以千金小姐身份举止的老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "71ebe981abc2b86adace3e08b6503aef5e404b2856a4f1d00af8e04e0925872e", "ja": "数か月前……", "zh": "数个月前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "667274bca5b2dacfa69acaa1c3b8b8cb9427836e7504889a386eaa464178b64e", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n今日集まってもらったのは、他でもないんだけど……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n今天把大家召集过来，其实是为了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "419a6832bb3c82014567849ae26ef8353276580597dcc9c99e97a5328006f36c", "ja": "このメンバーが集められたってことは、\n前に受けた映画のオーディションの話でしょ？", "zh": "既然把我们这些人召集到一起，那就是之前参加的电影试镜的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "fbed62c8a3bec742d3353f80586c97569c33ca68565805c8b6d71a960f09ed17", "ja": "あの、令嬢とか出てくる作品ですよね。\nそれで、結果はどうなったんですか？", "zh": "就是有千金小姐之类出场的那部作品吧。\n所以，结果怎么样了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "832068c86a18f5c3e3c89eb89f79ed3629b19856c73688bc2e93a3b6a9bb8525", "ja": "話が早いな。では、オーディションの結果だが……\n全員、合格だそうだ！　おめでとう！", "zh": "真是直奔主题啊。那么，关于试镜的结果……听说所有人都合格了！恭喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "3218ceabc5be0a6a82662c06de5bbade69b90a7fcc0ceb2608e739c35524c0a0", "ja": "ええっ、まさかの全員突破ですか！？", "zh": "诶？！没想到居然是全员通过吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "e97ca8b578c8a4ac45a0420673e0c2e4bd26a0c1aff8e3a7c4c6e93b78d3aa49", "ja": "なんと！？\nこれは、すごい映画になりそうです……！", "zh": "竟然是这样！？\n这下感觉会拍成一部不得了的电影……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "f1f09ab1bc76e4f4e4c73ee9c4b257b0226e474b4408ec415efad6bcc12fb759", "ja": "やったやった～！\nみんな揃って合格だ～、どんな映画かワクワクだ～♪", "zh": "太好了太好了～！\n大家都合格了～，真期待会拍出怎样的电影啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "51d14511b440565316766c25ce052ae04d6cf3d39a9a000329b9b6fe33effe4c", "ja": "それじゃ早速だけど、配役を発表するぞ。\n伯爵令嬢サーフィア・伊織、その侍女ソウヤ・静香。", "zh": "那么我就直接宣布演员分配了。  \n伯爵千金萨菲娅——伊织，侍女索雅——静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5be7254f0dee491ac6e5c80b44099a71d9671d1a1bc4be106bb0e619c54add60", "ja": "王子シトリム・亜利沙、ピュア令嬢アパテット・可奈。\n公爵トルマン・真。以上だ！", "zh": "王子希特里姆·亚利沙，纯洁千金阿帕特特·可奈。\n公爵托尔曼·真。以上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "e4aadf4f276c678eba962cb4c2cb20f3bb20d8e129ebfbfe73d2d1c533a9eb64", "ja": "わわっ、私と伊織さんが、令嬢役！？", "zh": "哇哇，我和伊织小姐演大小姐角色！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "a8f452355ab7565883e77c6ee2edc5f8c2ebd03f8cd147ea0aad9e510dfe7e05", "ja": "ありさと真くんが王子と公爵……\nあ、ありさが王子ですかぁ！？", "zh": "亚利沙和真演王子和公爵……\n亚、亚利沙演王子吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "f1f02c824a04e278ef55d28e3fb11bc71c036ef46cb2ca2fc2609da18199f90d", "ja": "ま、伊織ちゃん的には、当然よね！\n令嬢役なんて、私にピッタリだし♪", "zh": "不过，对伊织来说当然是这样啦！\n名门千金这种角色，和我再合适不过了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "d887d713f005409f6b073726633cf51d214b50bf2e875fc1c61759a9d1492839", "ja": "へー？　その割に伊織、律子から令嬢ものの\n小説を借りたって聞いたけど？", "zh": "是吗？可我听说伊织还向律子借了几本千金小姐题材的小说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "0aaa35e73c6aa9c570cbec4d6186bb21999efa5ff540a0d305ef68cafea9280f", "ja": "べ、別に、フィクションの令嬢が\nどんな感じなのか、ちょっと気になっただけよ！", "zh": "没、没什么！我只是有点想知道，虚构的千金小姐是什么样而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3cd1e83c0506cbac07d26c0c2d09d78351c18faa230373cdf9cc74ac2751dcea", "ja": "確かに、フィクションだしな。みんな、\n資料のコミックはオーディション前に読んだか？", "zh": "确实，毕竟是虚构作品嘛。大家，\n参考资料的漫画在试镜前都读过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "896d0c444f63e71d503c839cca416612d9bc1543e214f77fd6030b5915bbc34a", "ja": "はい。絵が綺麗で、すごく読みやすかったです。\n映画だと、どんなふうになるのかな……。", "zh": "是的。画得很漂亮，读起来非常轻松。\n如果拍成电影，会是什么样子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "e0b169c15bd07e5cf98467f1f5c5327b976e91287d743cf2c388c8a47c649bb5", "ja": "お話も素晴らしかったです！\nどのキャラクターも本当に魅力的で！", "zh": "故事也非常精彩！\n每个角色都真的很有魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "0d914d95e9dec687bbe9ce0154bd065d6b2d67666f56a70f153e79e3e996e5f6", "ja": "一体、どの役をどのアイドルちゃんが演じるのかと！\nありさも、興味津々だったんですケド……。", "zh": "究竟会由哪位偶像来饰演哪个角色呢！亚利沙也特别感兴趣，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "af6dadff0945eaaca5f701cacd42bd9f56271e73c76b0ee8675a268d332e783a", "ja": "亜利沙の王子役かぁ……\nどんな王子様になるか、気になるなぁ。", "zh": "由亚利沙来演王子啊……\n真想知道会成为怎样的王子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "873f4d983c132b9cad971419dedfa202642ccf3e9de9c937666af65bbabcd20b", "ja": "ううっ、真くんに言われるこのプレッシャー……！\nもちろん、ベストは尽くしますが！", "zh": "呜呜，被真这么一说感觉好有压力……！\n不过我当然会竭尽全力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "754c4513377b599cbab1b527b9bc81de58351b0b36f552eaa30110dfec30422e", "ja": "私は令嬢でも、裏表のある役なんですねー。\n意地悪な子は前にもやったから、大丈夫かな……？", "zh": "我饰演的既是千金小姐，也是一个表里不一的角色呢。之前也演过坏心眼的孩子，应该没问题吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ccdf6a90ec9bda7270c2d35bca5c22cd46a7e28bac3a7ad9dbc6e993c33c5de", "ja": "でもでも、私なりにがんばってみますっ！\nヴィランをやるのに～遠慮はいらん～♪", "zh": "不过不过，我也会用自己的方式努力的！\n要演反派嘛～不用客气～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "22f936c8b97d412468359e8a5062bd988f1c37f87f0f98a792d4ac7499b472a1", "ja": "公爵は、クセのある人物ですよね。オーディション前に\nコミックを読ませてもらって、よかったと思います！", "zh": "公爵是个很有个性的人物呢。能在试镜前读到漫画，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "b77ffedfab46ebcc444b657ed5826537f7c75d5422deca767b51f59b77af8142", "ja": "表情とか研究するのに、すごく役に立ちました。\nカッコいいだけじゃない、不思議な魅力があるなって。", "zh": "对研究表情之类的特别有帮助。感觉他不只是帅而已，还有种不可思议的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e6f8efa5d8291d51e764c9677899c4610304cfe6341a83e1fba0447156b74d34", "ja": "そうだな。捉えどころのなさが魅力というか……\n重要な役だと思う。頼んだぞ、真！", "zh": "是啊。该说是那种捉摸不透的感觉很有魅力吧……我觉得这是个很重要的角色。拜托你了，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "c33630197dcd54f481c8168049f7affa94ce508a47ce228d14cb779ffabb0e23", "ja": "任せてください！　伊織に負けないくらい、\n良い演技をしてみせます！", "zh": "交给我吧！我会拿出不输给伊织的精彩演技给你们看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "8a5fd4e396ccaa1ed0e08581ae7314db526bf9aadacf2471ea619e7e393de492", "ja": "何よ、言ってくれるじゃない。どう考えても、\n私のサーフィアが一番ハマり役だと思うけど？", "zh": "什么嘛，还真敢说。无论怎么想，我的萨菲娅才是最适合这个角色的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "f771b01d44ed4ce55528f6848b748d8ddfa668c0495817bd9e7e11042f06367f", "ja": "そんなこと言って、伊織、\nボクの公爵に食われないようにね？", "zh": "你说这种话，伊织，可要小心别被我的公爵吃掉了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "f63c349b564c2a7db83967524f77b02f28063831650d200908e7f5fbacd5f83f", "ja": "あーら、どの口がそんなことを言うのかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，真不知道你是怎么好意思说出这种话的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7eea25b4b93d7aefbd7504ba13024f85e9f14ed0921ae8ed7b016133e4bc40cd", "ja": "ははは。\nふたりとも、張り合うのもほどほどにな！", "zh": "哈哈哈。\n你们两个别较劲过头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "f696c87ddaffedae7176726a27b94e469a3b4d9c28701ca7ba1a0cb1eda33442", "ja": "私は、ヒロインのサーフィアが\nすごく素敵だな……って思いました。", "zh": "我觉得女主角萨菲娅真的非常棒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "a654d138ccba22adef7596eee0b0f47c945153ff4f16290fc09e3618b78b34a4", "ja": "貴族の令嬢で、周りからも色々言われるのに、\n自分を貫いていて……なんだか、カッコいいなって。", "zh": "明明是贵族家的小姐，周围的人还对她说三道四，\n她却依然坚持做自己……总觉得很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "a5f43c30f436e5c57bb1d5e89cb99726c8c5aa764cc544d1e07e7ee529dda54b", "ja": "わかるー！　サーフィアって綺麗なだけじゃなくて、\nカッコいいよね！", "zh": "我懂——！萨菲亚不仅漂亮，\n而且特别帅气对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e1231e57867eaae5cedc327482a007a87abe5e27d56dad5be88411298f52449", "ja": "そうね……。漫画だけど、所作も\nちゃんと洗練されてる感じがしたわね。", "zh": "是啊……虽然是漫画，但连举止也让人觉得十分讲究呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "a1eb2c2b8868819a1125c8426739bc2dfd9fdbc2c50dec3f9b5592d58a2c5b62", "ja": "確かに。基本的にはコメディなんだけど、全体の\n雰囲気がしまってる、っていうのかな……？", "zh": "确实。基本上是喜剧，但整体\n氛围很紧凑，该怎么说呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "78cdf5144f0a354147f97b63933ae9512c4628492c2a79ca2ae3749abe04bac3", "ja": "舞台になるのは、貴族の社交界ですから……。\nやっぱり、所作や雰囲気は重要ですよね。", "zh": "毕竟舞台设定是贵族的社交界……所以，举止和氛围果然很重要呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "78858358c6687fa941d2a86dfd241d25f1d26be2595bd40a540024d7cd4233d8", "ja": "見ている人は見ていますし、演技をしていく上でも、\nその辺りは意識しないとかも……。", "zh": "看戏的人眼睛都是雪亮的，在演戏的过程中，\n那方面也不能不在意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "e9b467e132cabbf69fdecda912b1a2b4a33601f1aaca3c0dd2b541ce7e6b5fb3", "ja": "貴族の社交界……。\nありさには馴染みのない世界すぎます……！", "zh": "贵族的社交界……对有纱来说，实在是太陌生了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "93cd417fd4ee4ba17dfd5f9cdd28adcc98e1cc0d27e04915cd1cf3d1fcc014a3", "ja": "稽古が始まれば、その辺りもフォローはしてくれると\n思うけど……できれば、先に覚えておきたいよな。", "zh": "我想，等排练开始后，那方面应该也会有人帮忙，不过……可以的话，还是想提前记住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "d8241aeb12454955510389b9a7217d68dff5b517c0cf81e811749ae864a3b3a5", "ja": "それなら、大丈夫です！　私たちの身近に、\n先生ができそうな人がいるじゃないですか♪", "zh": "那就没问题了！我们身边不是正好有一位适合当老师的人吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "0e37475f3457831c9087f230204207a1cf4e1092812b1fb94a5513115acd10b1", "ja": "……ああ！　そうか。\n確かに、伊織なら適任だな。", "zh": "……啊！原来如此。\n确实，伊织很合适呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "45d5f16ed85772eb4ed28157f046c4f3d2a679dc763fec491e2e58dcdc07d5a0", "ja": "それじゃ、先生役よろしくね。伊織♪", "zh": "那么，伊织就拜托你来当老师啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_01_1043_007ior", "source_sha256": "d936cc42b7124323f70d6cdf8628eff69a3dcbfe5f5ea6dba8084150b2a8a5fb", "ja": "へっ？　……せ、先生役ぅ！？", "zh": "诶？……让、让我演老师！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
